      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to present this exceptional 1-bedroom apartment to the market, nestled in the prestigious & highly sought after Slade Castle Development, Saggart.\nNo.51 Slade Castle Avenue comes to the market in turn key condition throughout.\nBoasting an impressive c.42 sq m of light filled living space, this home offers a welcoming entrance hallway, open plan lounge/kitchen/dining area, a main family bathroom and generous double bedroom.\nNo.51 is further enhanced by a generous balcony leading off the main lounge.\nSituated in the heart of Saggart Village, this highly sought-after development offers an abundance of conveniences right on your doorstep, including local bars, shops, schools, and parks. Commuters will appreciate the easy access to a variety of bus routes, the red line luas, as well as the nearby N7 and M50 road networks.\nPresented in turnkey condition, No. 51 further benefits from electric heating, a C1 energy rating & ample storage space. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality of this wonderful home.\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n- 1 bed, 1 bath\n- c.42 sqm\n- Turn key condition\n- Electric heating\n- Balcony leading from the lounge\n- Ample parking\n- Built c.2005\n- Turn key condition throughout\n- Ample storage space\n- Easy access to major routes & road networks\n- LUAS red line within walking distance\n- A host of amenities within walking distance\n\nBER details\nBER: C1\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 DD72\n"
      },
